  "name": "Resiliency (Ex)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Once per day, a thief with this ability can gain a number of temporary hit points equal to twice her thief level. Activating this ability is an immediate action that can be performed only when the thief is brought to below 0 hit points. This ability can be used to prevent the thief from dying. These temporary hit points last for 1 minute. If the thief's hit points drop below 0 due to the loss of these temporary hit points, she falls unconscious and is dying as normal.</p>",
